This directory contains the
[Molecule](https://docs.ansible.com/projects/molecule/) scenario of this
collection. `default` runs the modules on the control node against an API
endpoint you provide. It creates and changes only records whose names start with
`molecule_fixture_`, and removes them again. It provisions nothing: the
endpoint, its automation account and its recovery are yours.

Paths are relative to this directory unless stated otherwise.



